 (Pedro Pascal) y su joven aprendiz Grogu.\n\nOriginal title: Star Wars: Th
 e Mandalorian and Grogu\n\nRelease year: 2026\n\nOriginal language: EN\n\n
 Audio: VOSE\n\nhttps://yelmocines.es/sinopsis/the-mandalorian-and-grogu
